            <ArticleTitle>[Bilateral splanchnicectomy according to the Dubois method in pain caused by chronic pancreatitis and by inoperable neoplasms of the pancreas].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>827-30</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors report a personal series of 12 p. undergoing splanchnicectomy through Dubois' transhiatal approach because of abdominal pain of pancreatic origin. They underline this technique produces immediately a total, lasting pain relief, improving quality of life of these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
